For whomever wants to take a look — the issue is that log(sigma) is going very negative
such that exp(log(sigma) underflows to zero (all the initializations are actually fine).
It kind of looks like a Jacobian isn’t being applied or something — adding a prior will only
puts more mass on these extremely small values for sigma.

