the same answer in the same time as RStan 2.1.0.

Good point about a prior not helping for sigma.

We should definitely sort this one out before release.  It's
hard to imagine the Jacobian isn't getting applied --- I'd think
things would go nuts everywhere if that were the case, I'd think.
I should look at the log probs out to make sure.

- Bob

