line that the R code in the instructions writes to .R/

CXXFLAGS="-mtune=native  -O3 -Wall -pedantic -Wconversion

That line isn't included above where the instructions say that
Makevars should have exactly:

CXX=g++ -arch x86_64 -ftemplate-depth-256 -stdlib=libstdc++

-David

