Subject: Re: [stan-dev] Reusable {Cmd,R,Py}Stan components -- where should they go?
Message-ID: <YybnQSjOLko.mPfmaNdN_wcJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <YybnQSjOLko.EnTmKLh_LecJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
References: <YybnQSjOLko.Ul1TQ0gH1i0J@stan-dev.groups.google.com> <YybnQSjOLko.EnTmKLh_LecJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-dev/c/YybnQSjOLko/m/mPfmaNdN_wcJ>
