Again, it depends on how you define Stan — is it
a collection of libraries useful for Bayesian inference
with some of those libraries dedicated to interfacing
with external UIs, or is it an execution of Bayesian
inference with supporting libraries?  In the former
case I’d suggest ui, in the latter I’d go with core.

