I like shared and core, I'll propose "common" as well.

My top choice is probably still "api", leveraging the redundancy of API, i.e.,
if Stan is an API by definition, then stan::api should be an API to the API.
>From the perspective of RStan and PyStan, that's what is.

Best wishes,

-a

